<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-INDIA 290-6 AT LUNCH V WESTINDIES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 290-6 AT LUNCH V WESTINDIES.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN, Barbados 1997-03-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 290 for six at lunch on Sunday in reply to West Indies first innings total of 298 on the third day of the third cricket test.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 298; India 290-6 (S.Tendulkar 92, R.Dravid 78).</p>
